   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Those aren&#39;t <span>ctmm</span> objects or functions - that looks like the <span>amt</span> package, so you would have to ask \r\nJohannes about that specific error.<br></div><div><br></div><div><span>ctmm</span> can import long-lat and UTM data if it is in the Movebank format. The working projection then needs to be one in meters that is relatively centered on the data.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Chris<br></div>"
    ],
    [
